{
  "cases": [
    {
      "i": 21300,
      "title": "Sandbox environment: Refunds not updating and tax calculations wrong",
      "description": "We are experiencing two distinct issues in our Payment Gateway v2 sandbox environment. First, when processing refunds, the status does not reflect the change in the dashboard, although the transaction appears to complete on the backend. Second, the tax amount applied to new transactions is incorrect compared to our configured rates. This is blocking our UAT phase for 2,132 test users and is considered a critical blocker for our release timeline. Please advise."
    },
    {
      "i": 21301,
      "title": "Subscription Manager errors: Incorrect tax and declined payments in Dev",
      "description": "Our development team is reporting issues with the Subscription Manager in the ME region. Users are seeing incorrect tax amounts on invoices, and several payment attempts are being declined unexpectedly. The logs show some latency spikes during these transactions, but it's unclear if the issue originates from the subscription logic itself or if the underlying data indexing is failing to retrieve the correct pricing rules. We need to know if this is a configuration issue on our end or a service-side fault."
    },
    {
      "i": 21302,
      "title": "UI issues in Feedback Collector",
      "description": "The feedback form looks broken. Buttons are misaligned and some elements aren't showing up at all. It's happening in prod. Please fix."
    },
    {
      "i": 21303,
      "title": "Wallet Service billing error",
      "description": "We are seeing undercharges in the Wallet Service. Amounts are lower than they should be. Affects a small group of users in production. Need help."
    },
    {
      "i": 21304,
      "title": "Critical: Password reset links expiring immediately in Production",
      "description": "We are seeing a widespread failure in the SSO Integration Module in the US-West production environment. Approximately 16,435 users are unable to reset their passwords because the reset links are marked as 'expired' immediately upon clicking, or sometimes even before they are accessed by the user. We have verified the email delivery is successful, but the token validation seems to fail instantly. This is a critical issue preventing login recovery for our entire user base."
    },
    {
      "i": 21305,
      "title": "Currency conversion discrepancies and audit log mismatches",
      "description": "In the EU-Central production environment, we are noticing that currency conversions in Payment Gateway v2 are producing amounts that do not match the expected rates. Furthermore, when we cross-reference these transactions with the Audit Log Service, the recorded amounts differ from what is displayed in the payment gateway interface. We cannot determine if the conversion logic is flawed or if the logging service is capturing pre-conversion values incorrectly. This has impacted 2,758 users."
    },
    {
      "i": 21306,
      "title": "MFA codes rejected in Staging",
      "description": "We are testing MFA flows in the LATAM staging environment. Two specific test accounts are having their MFA codes rejected consistently. We suspect this is because the server cluster doesn't have enough capacity to handle the concurrent authentication requests during our load tests, causing timeouts or race conditions in the code validation. It's definitely a capacity planning issue on the infrastructure side."
    },
    {
      "i": 21307,
      "title": "Duplicate charges and incorrect tax calculations in Dev",
      "description": "Our development team using Payment Gateway v2 in US-East is reporting that subscriptions are being charged twice in quick succession. Additionally, when the charges do go through, the tax amount applied is incorrect. We have 58 developers affected by this, which is slowing down our integration testing significantly. The duplicate charges are confirmed via bank statement mocks, and the tax error seems consistent across all affected accounts."
    },
    {
      "i": 21308,
      "title": "Role Manager: Missing audit logs and account lockouts",
      "description": "We are facing multiple issues with the Role Manager in the EU-West development environment. Audit logs are missing recent entries, we are receiving 'certificate expired' warnings that seem incorrect, and several accounts are being locked out unexpectedly. We are confident this is due to an incomplete rollback of a recent deployment, where some security configurations were not restored to their previous state. Please investigate the deployment history."
    },
    {
      "i": 21309,
      "title": "Production Latency: Autoscaling failure and capacity limits reached",
      "description": "Deploy Manager in the LATAM production region is experiencing severe performance degradation. We have hit the instance capacity limits, and autoscaling is failing to trigger despite a sustained CPU usage spike above 90%. This has resulted in high latency for 13,029 users. We need immediate assistance to either manually scale up the infrastructure or diagnose why the autoscaling policies are not reacting to the load."
    },
    {
      "i": 21310,
      "title": "SSO Integration Module issues in Staging: Lockouts and MFA failures",
      "description": "In the EU-West staging environment, we are seeing inconsistent behavior with the SSO Integration Module. Some users are being locked out after a single failed attempt. Others report that MFA codes are being rejected even when entered correctly. A third group is not seeing the MFA prompt at all and is being logged in directly. These issues are affecting 56 test users and are making it impossible to validate our new authentication flow."
    },
    {
      "i": 21311,
      "title": "Token Service: MFA rejection, lockouts, and session expirations",
      "description": "We are encountering a series of authentication failures in the Token Service within the ME development environment. Users are reporting that MFA codes are rejected. Subsequently, their accounts get locked out. Additionally, those who manage to log in experience unexpected session expirations shortly after. This cluster of issues is impacting 100 users and is blocking our authentication testing."
    },
    {
      "i": 21312,
      "title": "Duplicate subscription charges in LATAM Staging",
      "description": "We are observing that subscriptions are being charged twice in the Payment Gateway v2 staging environment for the LATAM region. This issue is affecting 930 users during our integration tests. We need to identify why the duplicate transactions are occurring, as this will impact our billing accuracy checks before we move to production."
    },
    {
      "i": 21313,
      "title": "High latency impacting mobile app via Data Export Service",
      "description": "Our mobile application is experiencing significant performance delays. We have traced the bottleneck to the Data Export Service in the ME production region, which is returning data with high latency. This is affecting the responsiveness of the app for 24,678 users. We need to investigate the service performance and determine the cause of the slowdown."
    },
    {
      "i": 21314,
      "title": "Login failures and missing password reset emails in APAC Production",
      "description": "Users in the APAC region are reporting that they cannot log in. When they attempt to reset their passwords via the Payment Gateway v2 interface, no email is received. We have confirmed that the 'forgot password' function is being triggered, but the communication is failing silently. This is preventing 333 users from accessing their accounts and is a high-priority issue."
    }
